# STORY (Year 1 research + story), batch 2: captured Cobra tech and the clue library decodes.
# Cobra gear needs "Who Is Cobra?" (gijoe_story_act1.rul) and the recovered item. Wreckage and clue items are
# defined here (sprite = the ledger's 100 for now); Cobra WEAPON items are BUILD's: STR_COBRA_REVOLVER and
# STR_COBRA_RIFLE are the ids proposed to BUILD; STR_ALIEN_GRENADE is the mod's existing Cobra Grenade.
# What a prisoner or wreck teaches follows what Cobra has actually built (John, 12 Nov).
